# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Interactive Reviewer — keep the deployed site to just the app + question banks
#
# The published site is: *.html, css/, js/ (incl. js/data/*.js). Everything below
# is local source material or one-off extraction scaffolding that should NOT be
# pushed. (Files already committed before this .gitignore are unaffected — this
# only prevents NEW scratch files from being added. Run `git rm --cached <path>`
# if you want to stop tracking something that's already committed.)
# The reusable helper scripts in tools/ are intentionally kept (see /*.py note).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# One-off extraction/build scripts at the repo root (tools/ is NOT matched)
/*.py

# Raw text and intermediate build dumps
/*_raw.txt
/*_output.txt
/*_analysis.txt
/*_parsed.json
/*_extract.json
/*_questions.json
/*_merged.js
/*_questions.js

# Source PDFs and the drop folder for new material (kept locally, not deployed)
/pdfs/
/new files/
/canvas version/
/externals/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/
